  "description": "San I-Hyeon has had a crush on his high school classmate and roommate, Cha Gyu-Bin, for six years. One day, after accidentally discovering that Gyu-Bin has a thing for BDSM, I-Hyeon impulsively heads to an SM bar. Far from finding a way to win Gyu-Bin over, he nearly gets dragged off by a drunken pervert... Just then, Gyu-Bin shows up and rescues I-Hyeon, mistakenly assuming he shares his interests. I-Hyeon takes advantage of Gyu-Bin’s misunderstanding to propose they become partners… \n\n*“I’m not into SM. I’m into D&D.”\n\n“To put it simply, I’m the Master, and you’re the slave.”*\n\nHigh school classmate, best friend, roommate, and now his Master…\n\nWill I-Hyeon finally be able to confess his feelings?\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
